         measured: deep: u~0: mu_2 ~ 2u -> lap phi ~ 4 pi G rho (Newtonian); the bracket correction is 1e-5-class where finite
         reading : the candidate that was built to reproduce div[mu_2 grad phi] = 4 pi G rho_bar reproduces Poisson instead: the RHS multiplied by mu_2 is NOT the MOND law -- the AQUAL source must be mu_2-free (a linear-in-phi trace coupling = candidate (a), with its WEP price).
